      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477534266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return for my VeloBand Cadence Sensor.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21159,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477538866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477543066666
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not working. It's broken. It won't sync with my phone or my bike computer. I've tried everything the manual says.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21159,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477553066666
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. I'm sorry to hear that. We could try some troubleshooting steps or I can connect you with...",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477561133332
    },
    {
      "text": "No. I don't have time for that. The product is defective and I want to return it. Can you process a return, yes or no?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21159,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767477567933332
    },
    {
